---
import DocsLayout from "../layouts/DocsLayout.astro";
---

<DocsLayout title="Install And Quick Start | DP-LMI Package">
  <section class="hero compact">
    <h1>Install And Quick Start</h1>
    <p class="lead">
      Add the repository to MATLAB's path, exclude documentation folders, then
      run the package test entry point from the repository root.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <h2>Path Setup</h2>
    <pre><code>{`projectRoot = "path/to/Differential Parameter-Dependent Linear Matrix Inequality";
addpath(genpath(projectRoot));
rmpath(genpath(fullfile(projectRoot, "doc")));`}</code></pre>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <h2>Verification</h2>
    <p>
      The current tests cover helper utilities, backend storage, known-data
      matrices, decision expressions, rate derivatives, direct LMI assembly,
      and solver smoke paths. <code>dpvar</code> and <code>dplmi</code> tests
      require YALMIP.
    </p>
    <pre><code>{`results = tests.run_all;`}</code></pre>
    <p>
      Solver smoke tests prefer MOSEK when available and fall back to
      <code>lmilab</code> otherwise.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <h2>First Objects</h2>
    <pre><code>{`A = dpmat({[0 1]}, {2, 4}, Degree=1);
P = dpvar(2, {[0 1 2]}, "symmetric");
C = P >= 0;
class(C)

ans =

    "dplmi"`}</code></pre>
  </section>
</DocsLayout>
